  "duration_s": 276.408889,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "今天晚上李总组了个局陈，总也会过去。琳琳小张，你俩跟我一起去。好的，王姐没问题。王姐，对了，今晚来的都是重要客户，说话做事都注意点，放心吧，王姐，我肯定不给您丢脸哟。王姐来了，快坐快坐。不好意思，让两位久等了，哪里哪里都是自己人。小张啊，今天高兴，刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句，那祝大家吃好喝。好，我先干了王姐，那我也借这个机会说两句。好，你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，也感谢王姐带我们过来，让我们有幸认识各位前辈，我叫琳琳。俗话说，相聚是一种缘分。此时此刻，我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，祝各位扶摇直上，九万里事业长虹节节高。好，王姐，来这杯，我敬你陈总这杯，我替王姐敬您，我敬的是你们领导，你是领导吗？瞧您说的，您敬的是我领导，我同样敬的也是领导，您敬领导是心意，我敬您是尊敬这杯，我敬的是生意，咱们随意，祝您生意一路超红，万事顺畅。哈哈哈哈哈哈这小姑娘会说话。玲玲刚才说的不错，来咱俩喝一个，谢谢李总。嗯，来怎么到？我这就剩半杯了，平底酒，这叫发财酒，到底发财好事再来好一个发财酒。琳玲，我再问你个问题，你觉得我和李总你更喜欢谁？领导怎能用喜欢呢？那得是尊敬两位领导，我都尊敬啊。这姑娘聪明，玲莲这条鱼没怎么动，都是自己人，别嫌弃，一会儿打包带回吃吧，还能补补身子。莲莲陈总让你拿，你就拿着呗，太感谢陈总了，但是一整条鱼我自己也吃不完。我平时喜欢吃鱼尾，上面这部分我给您打包带回去给嫂子也尝一下，以后还希望您多多照顾。哈哈哈。看来今天这条鱼没白点。琳琳陈总那边刚来消息，昨天谈的那个项目确定跟咱们合作了，而且陈总还特意提了一句，后面让你负责对接，谢谢王姐，我一定把它做好。琳琳，我现在是真服你了，怎么了？你想想啊。那天陈总说我敬的是你们领导，你是领导吗？换成我，我当场就不知道该说什么了。饭局上突然让你讲话，给李总倒酒，只剩半杯。陈总又问你，他和李总你更喜欢谁？还有最后那条鱼，我到现在才明白，陈总说的根本就不只是鱼，是你到底是怎么练的？为什么别人突然给你一句话，你马上就知道该怎么接。其实我以前跟你一样，不爱说话，也不知道怎么组织语言，一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。后来我就经常看这本闲谈高手，它里面就是一个场景的场景的告诉你，遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。比如别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能接的这么快，这种东西不是天生的，就是平时一个场景，一个场景的，看一个场景，一个场景的练。每天看两页，慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，应该怎么说？这里面还有很多生活里的场景，比如对象给你发红包，你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。同事向你借钱，你又不想借，可以回，大家都是一样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，你可以回随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费。哈哈这个有意思，我第一次读到这些的时候，真的有种豁然开朗的感觉。这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，一个一个拆开给你看，别人怎么说，你可以怎么接，都是一句一句给你举例。所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，每天不用看很多看两页，碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，你就知道怎么接了。这本先借，我看看拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 2070,
      "text": "今天晚上李总组了个局陈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2070,
      "end_ms": 2910,
      "text": "总也会过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3070,
      "end_ms": 3750,
      "text": "琳琳小张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3750,
      "end_ms": 4590,
      "text": "你俩跟我一起去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4870,
      "end_ms": 5190,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00006",
      "start_ms": 5190,
      "end_ms": 6390,
      "text": "王姐没问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00007",
      "start_ms": 6390,
      "end_ms": 6750,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00008",
      "start_ms": 6970,
      "end_ms": 7410,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00009",
      "start_ms": 7910,
      "end_ms": 9490,
      "text": "今晚来的都是重要客户，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00010",
      "start_ms": 9850,
      "end_ms": 11170,
      "text": "说话做事都注意点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00011",
      "start_ms": 11510,
      "end_ms": 11930,
      "text": "放心吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00012",
      "start_ms": 11930,
      "end_ms": 12270,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00013",
      "start_ms": 12270,
      "end_ms": 20570,
      "text": "我肯定不给您丢脸哟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20870,
      "end_ms": 21730,
      "text": "王姐来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00015",
      "start_ms": 21770,
      "end_ms": 22490,
      "text": "快坐快坐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00016",
      "start_ms": 23110,
      "end_ms": 23750,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00017",
      "start_ms": 23910,
      "end_ms": 24870,
      "text": "让两位久等了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00018",
      "start_ms": 25090,
      "end_ms": 26975,
      "text": "哪里哪里都是自己人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32730,
      "end_ms": 33190,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33190,
      "end_ms": 33810,
      "text": "今天高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00021",
      "start_ms": 34030,
      "end_ms": 36255,
      "text": "刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00022",
      "start_ms": 38220,
      "end_ms": 39320,
      "text": "那祝大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00023",
      "start_ms": 39320,
      "end_ms": 39500,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00024",
      "start_ms": 39500,
      "end_ms": 45150,
      "text": "我先干了王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00025",
      "start_ms": 45510,
      "end_ms": 46990,
      "text": "那我也借这个机会说两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47230,
      "end_ms": 47470,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00027",
      "start_ms": 47610,
      "end_ms": 49930,
      "text": "你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00028",
      "start_ms": 50050,
      "end_ms": 51230,
      "text": "也感谢王姐带我们过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00029",
      "start_ms": 51230,
      "end_ms": 52610,
      "text": "让我们有幸认识各位前辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52630,
      "end_ms": 53250,
      "text": "我叫琳琳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53410,
      "end_ms": 53970,
      "text": "俗话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00032",
      "start_ms": 54210,
      "end_ms": 55350,
      "text": "相聚是一种缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00033",
      "start_ms": 55570,
      "end_ms": 56250,
      "text": "此时此刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00034",
      "start_ms": 56330,
      "end_ms": 58390,
      "text": "我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00035",
      "start_ms": 58590,
      "end_ms": 59730,
      "text": "祝各位扶摇直上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00036",
      "start_ms": 59730,
      "end_ms": 61510,
      "text": "九万里事业长虹节节高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00037",
      "start_ms": 62370,
      "end_ms": 62775,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00038",
      "start_ms": 63100,
      "end_ms": 63440,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00039",
      "start_ms": 63500,
      "end_ms": 64520,
      "text": "来这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00040",
      "start_ms": 64520,
      "end_ms": 67230,
      "text": "我敬你陈总这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00041",
      "start_ms": 67230,
      "end_ms": 68355,
      "text": "我替王姐敬您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00042",
      "start_ms": 69170,
      "end_ms": 70525,
      "text": "我敬的是你们领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00043",
      "start_ms": 70810,
      "end_ms": 71645,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00044",
      "start_ms": 75350,
      "end_ms": 76175,
      "text": "瞧您说的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00045",
      "start_ms": 76490,
      "end_ms": 77530,
      "text": "您敬的是我领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00046",
      "start_ms": 77730,
      "end_ms": 79045,
      "text": "我同样敬的也是领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00047",
      "start_ms": 79320,
      "end_ms": 80560,
      "text": "您敬领导是心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00048",
      "start_ms": 80620,
      "end_ms": 82600,
      "text": "我敬您是尊敬这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00049",
      "start_ms": 82600,
      "end_ms": 83480,
      "text": "我敬的是生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00050",
      "start_ms": 83660,
      "end_ms": 84320,
      "text": "咱们随意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00051",
      "start_ms": 84320,
      "end_ms": 85660,
      "text": "祝您生意一路超红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00052",
      "start_ms": 85780,
      "end_ms": 86615,
      "text": "万事顺畅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00053",
      "start_ms": 87070,
      "end_ms": 90325,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈这小姑娘会说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00054",
      "start_ms": 90640,
      "end_ms": 92060,
      "text": "玲玲刚才说的不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00055",
      "start_ms": 92120,
      "end_ms": 93000,
      "text": "来咱俩喝一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00056",
      "start_ms": 93000,
      "end_ms": 93665,
      "text": "谢谢李总。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00057",
      "start_ms": 93970,
      "end_ms": 94175,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00058",
      "start_ms": 96770,
      "end_ms": 97700,
      "text": "来怎么到？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00059",
      "start_ms": 97700,
      "end_ms": 98760,
      "text": "我这就剩半杯了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00060",
      "start_ms": 98980,
      "end_ms": 99780,
      "text": "平底酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00061",
      "start_ms": 99780,
      "end_ms": 100660,
      "text": "这叫发财酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00062",
      "start_ms": 100800,
      "end_ms": 105465,
      "text": "到底发财好事再来好一个发财酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00063",
      "start_ms": 105890,
      "end_ms": 106250,
      "text": "琳玲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00064",
      "start_ms": 106830,
      "end_ms": 107855,
      "text": "我再问你个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00065",
      "start_ms": 108620,
      "end_ms": 111105,
      "text": "你觉得我和李总你更喜欢谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00066",
      "start_ms": 112880,
      "end_ms": 114195,
      "text": "领导怎能用喜欢呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00067",
      "start_ms": 114430,
      "end_ms": 115980,
      "text": "那得是尊敬两位领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00068",
      "start_ms": 115980,
      "end_ms": 119120,
      "text": "我都尊敬啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00069",
      "start_ms": 119460,
      "end_ms": 120485,
      "text": "这姑娘聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00070",
      "start_ms": 122050,
      "end_ms": 124295,
      "text": "玲莲这条鱼没怎么动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00071",
      "start_ms": 124740,
      "end_ms": 125500,
      "text": "都是自己人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00072",
      "start_ms": 125500,
      "end_ms": 126080,
      "text": "别嫌弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00073",
      "start_ms": 126160,
      "end_ms": 127400,
      "text": "一会儿打包带回吃吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00074",
      "start_ms": 127400,
      "end_ms": 128345,
      "text": "还能补补身子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00075",
      "start_ms": 128550,
      "end_ms": 130300,
      "text": "莲莲陈总让你拿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00076",
      "start_ms": 130340,
      "end_ms": 131155,
      "text": "你就拿着呗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00077",
      "start_ms": 131780,
      "end_ms": 132785,
      "text": "太感谢陈总了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00078",
      "start_ms": 133120,
      "end_ms": 134695,
      "text": "但是一整条鱼我自己也吃不完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00079",
      "start_ms": 135060,
      "end_ms": 136320,
      "text": "我平时喜欢吃鱼尾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00080",
      "start_ms": 136480,
      "end_ms": 138955,
      "text": "上面这部分我给您打包带回去给嫂子也尝一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00081",
      "start_ms": 139210,
      "end_ms": 140565,
      "text": "以后还希望您多多照顾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00082",
      "start_ms": 140980,
      "end_ms": 141575,
      "text": "哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00083",
      "start_ms": 142080,
      "end_ms": 143845,
      "text": "看来今天这条鱼没白点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00084",
      "start_ms": 146650,
      "end_ms": 148780,
      "text": "琳琳陈总那边刚来消息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00085",
      "start_ms": 148880,
      "end_ms": 151285,
      "text": "昨天谈的那个项目确定跟咱们合作了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00086",
      "start_ms": 151480,
      "end_ms": 152960,
      "text": "而且陈总还特意提了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00087",
      "start_ms": 153020,
      "end_ms": 154245,
      "text": "后面让你负责对接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00088",
      "start_ms": 154500,
      "end_ms": 155160,
      "text": "谢谢王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00089",
      "start_ms": 155220,
      "end_ms": 156285,
      "text": "我一定把它做好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00090",
      "start_ms": 158040,
      "end_ms": 158455,
      "text": "琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00091",
      "start_ms": 159130,
      "end_ms": 160425,
      "text": "我现在是真服你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00092",
      "start_ms": 161860,
      "end_ms": 162320,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00093",
      "start_ms": 162600,
      "end_ms": 163245,
      "text": "你想想啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00094",
      "start_ms": 163470,
      "end_ms": 165810,
      "text": "那天陈总说我敬的是你们领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00095",
      "start_ms": 165930,
      "end_ms": 166750,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00096",
      "start_ms": 166830,
      "end_ms": 167290,
      "text": "换成我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00097",
      "start_ms": 167290,
      "end_ms": 168750,
      "text": "我当场就不知道该说什么了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00098",
      "start_ms": 168750,
      "end_ms": 170070,
      "text": "饭局上突然让你讲话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00099",
      "start_ms": 170190,
      "end_ms": 170870,
      "text": "给李总倒酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00100",
      "start_ms": 170870,
      "end_ms": 171534,
      "text": "只剩半杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00101",
      "start_ms": 171790,
      "end_ms": 172410,
      "text": "陈总又问你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00102",
      "start_ms": 172410,
      "end_ms": 173775,
      "text": "他和李总你更喜欢谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00103",
      "start_ms": 174650,
      "end_ms": 175525,
      "text": "还有最后那条鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00104",
      "start_ms": 176020,
      "end_ms": 177100,
      "text": "我到现在才明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00105",
      "start_ms": 177220,
      "end_ms": 178705,
      "text": "陈总说的根本就不只是鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00106",
      "start_ms": 179060,
      "end_ms": 180820,
      "text": "是你到底是怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00107",
      "start_ms": 180960,
      "end_ms": 182460,
      "text": "为什么别人突然给你一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00108",
      "start_ms": 182460,
      "end_ms": 183735,
      "text": "你马上就知道该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00109",
      "start_ms": 184130,
      "end_ms": 185305,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00110",
      "start_ms": 185710,
      "end_ms": 186390,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00111",
      "start_ms": 186650,
      "end_ms": 188050,
      "text": "也不知道怎么组织语言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00112",
      "start_ms": 188270,
      "end_ms": 190345,
      "text": "一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00113",
      "start_ms": 190890,
      "end_ms": 192985,
      "text": "后来我就经常看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00114",
      "start_ms": 193330,
      "end_ms": 195610,
      "text": "它里面就是一个场景的场景的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00115",
      "start_ms": 195610,
      "end_ms": 197955,
      "text": "遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00116",
      "start_ms": 198280,
      "end_ms": 199760,
      "text": "比如别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00117",
      "start_ms": 199880,
      "end_ms": 200480,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00118",
      "start_ms": 200820,
      "end_ms": 201780,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00119",
      "start_ms": 201820,
      "end_ms": 203100,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00120",
      "start_ms": 203240,
      "end_ms": 204520,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00121",
      "start_ms": 204540,
      "end_ms": 206060,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00122",
      "start_ms": 206220,
      "end_ms": 207180,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00123",
      "start_ms": 207180,
      "end_ms": 209875,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00124",
      "start_ms": 210050,
      "end_ms": 211110,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00125",
      "start_ms": 211230,
      "end_ms": 212385,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00126",
      "start_ms": 212620,
      "end_ms": 213740,
      "text": "强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00127",
      "start_ms": 213880,
      "end_ms": 215200,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00128",
      "start_ms": 215300,
      "end_ms": 216945,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能接的这么快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00129",
      "start_ms": 217370,
      "end_ms": 218765,
      "text": "这种东西不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00130",
      "start_ms": 219180,
      "end_ms": 220120,
      "text": "就是平时一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00131",
      "start_ms": 220120,
      "end_ms": 220680,
      "text": "一个场景的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00132",
      "start_ms": 220680,
      "end_ms": 221520,
      "text": "看一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00133",
      "start_ms": 221520,
      "end_ms": 222305,
      "text": "一个场景的练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00134",
      "start_ms": 222680,
      "end_ms": 223500,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00135",
      "start_ms": 223700,
      "end_ms": 225420,
      "text": "慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00136",
      "start_ms": 225420,
      "end_ms": 226100,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00137",
      "start_ms": 226380,
      "end_ms": 228235,
      "text": "这里面还有很多生活里的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00138",
      "start_ms": 228510,
      "end_ms": 229670,
      "text": "比如对象给你发红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00139",
      "start_ms": 229670,
      "end_ms": 232385,
      "text": "你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00140",
      "start_ms": 233010,
      "end_ms": 234070,
      "text": "同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00141",
      "start_ms": 234210,
      "end_ms": 235070,
      "text": "你又不想借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00142",
      "start_ms": 235150,
      "end_ms": 235765,
      "text": "可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00143",
      "start_ms": 236090,
      "end_ms": 237315,
      "text": "大家都是一样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00144",
      "start_ms": 237640,
      "end_ms": 238300,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00145",
      "start_ms": 238380,
      "end_ms": 239185,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00146",
      "start_ms": 239460,
      "end_ms": 241740,
      "text": "还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00147",
      "start_ms": 241740,
      "end_ms": 243440,
      "text": "你可以回随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00148",
      "start_ms": 243700,
      "end_ms": 244845,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00149",
      "start_ms": 245080,
      "end_ms": 246025,
      "text": "目前不收费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00150",
      "start_ms": 246430,
      "end_ms": 248015,
      "text": "哈哈这个有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00151",
      "start_ms": 248540,
      "end_ms": 249900,
      "text": "我第一次读到这些的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00152",
      "start_ms": 249900,
      "end_ms": 251615,
      "text": "真的有种豁然开朗的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00153",
      "start_ms": 252100,
      "end_ms": 255925,
      "text": "这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00154",
      "start_ms": 256160,
      "end_ms": 257545,
      "text": "一个一个拆开给你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00155",
      "start_ms": 257910,
      "end_ms": 258650,
      "text": "别人怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00156",
      "start_ms": 258730,
      "end_ms": 259545,
      "text": "你可以怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00157",
      "start_ms": 259820,
      "end_ms": 261240,
      "text": "都是一句一句给你举例。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00158",
      "start_ms": 261460,
      "end_ms": 263320,
      "text": "所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00159",
      "start_ms": 263720,
      "end_ms": 265400,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00160",
      "start_ms": 265480,
      "end_ms": 268930,
      "text": "碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00161",
      "start_ms": 269010,
      "end_ms": 271170,
      "text": "工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00162",
      "start_ms": 271190,
      "end_ms": 272315,
      "text": "你就知道怎么接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00163",
      "start_ms": 273280,
      "end_ms": 273840,
      "text": "这本先借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00164",
      "start_ms": 273840,
      "end_ms": 275430,
      "text": "我看看拿去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7895546933c47e17_s00165",
      "start_ms": 275430,
      "end_ms": 276235,
      "text": "回去慢慢看。"
    }
  ],
